.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "snakepit fangs" 1  "snakepit fangs " 
.SH NAME
snakepit fangs \- 🦷 Hallucinatory Fangs — modify module behavior safely
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnakepit fangs\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
🦷 Hallucinatory Fangs — modify module behavior safely
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
snakepit fangs\-fork(1)
🍴 Fork a module for modification
.TP
snakepit fangs\-log(1)
📝 Add logging to a function
.TP
snakepit fangs\-retry(1)
🔁 Add retry logic to a function
.TP
snakepit fangs\-cache(1)
💾 Add caching to a function
.TP
snakepit fangs\-mock(1)
🎭 Mock function return value
.TP
snakepit fangs\-custom(1)
💉 Inject custom code into a function
.TP
snakepit fangs\-list(1)
📋 List all forked modules
.TP
snakepit fangs\-rollback(1)
⏪ Rollback modifications to a module
.TP
snakepit fangs\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
